{"4809260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Train Goes Choo Choo", "steam_appid": 4809260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sit back and let yourself be transported. This game is a nostalgic window into rural Japan, designed for those looking for a peaceful corner, a relaxing background while studying or working, or simply something rejuvenating to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/3d41ada9fb31e94d85cfd8cdee68fd7a.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/3d41ada9fb31e94d85cfd8cdee68fd7a.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/3d41ada9fb31e94d85cfd8cdee68fd7a.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Set the Mood: Time and Weather</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your ideal atmosphere by combining the light of the morning, the warm colors of the afternoon, or the quiet of the night with the effects of rain, snow, and wind. You decide the perfect visual and audio backdrop for your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2f4dd32fafe6610267ed2b0d7d6923e0.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2f4dd32fafe6610267ed2b0d7d6923e0.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2f4dd32fafe6610267ed2b0d7d6923e0.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Style Your Train</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your favorite combination by selecting the color of the train. Adapt the look of the carriage to your taste and create the perfect aesthetic for your lo-fi panorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/d7d6c04ec98b92ef921d229799528dcf.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/d7d6c04ec98b92ef921d229799528dcf.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/d7d6c04ec98b92ef921d229799528dcf.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Capture the Moment with Photo Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a moment to stop time. Use photo mode to move the camera and move freely through space, capturing the perfect image of your journey through rural Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2b549ae8ae985442a58a70b9d912fafa.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2b549ae8ae985442a58a70b9d912fafa.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2b549ae8ae985442a58a70b9d912fafa.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>An Endless Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Farmlands, rice paddies reflecting the light, small traditional villages, and silent forests will flow endlessly on the tracks. There is no final destination, just a constant and regenerating flow to get lost in. Find your seat on the train and disconnect from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sit back and let yourself be transported. This game is a nostalgic window into rural Japan, designed for those looking for a peaceful corner, a relaxing background while studying or working, or simply something rejuvenating to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/3d41ada9fb31e94d85cfd8cdee68fd7a.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/3d41ada9fb31e94d85cfd8cdee68fd7a.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/3d41ada9fb31e94d85cfd8cdee68fd7a.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Set the Mood: Time and Weather</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your ideal atmosphere by combining the light of the morning, the warm colors of the afternoon, or the quiet of the night with the effects of rain, snow, and wind. You decide the perfect visual and audio backdrop for your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2f4dd32fafe6610267ed2b0d7d6923e0.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2f4dd32fafe6610267ed2b0d7d6923e0.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2f4dd32fafe6610267ed2b0d7d6923e0.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Style Your Train</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your favorite combination by selecting the color of the train. Adapt the look of the carriage to your taste and create the perfect aesthetic for your lo-fi panorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/d7d6c04ec98b92ef921d229799528dcf.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/d7d6c04ec98b92ef921d229799528dcf.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/d7d6c04ec98b92ef921d229799528dcf.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Capture the Moment with Photo Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a moment to stop time. Use photo mode to move the camera and move freely through space, capturing the perfect image of your journey through rural Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2b549ae8ae985442a58a70b9d912fafa.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2b549ae8ae985442a58a70b9d912fafa.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/2b549ae8ae985442a58a70b9d912fafa.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>An Endless Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Farmlands, rice paddies reflecting the light, small traditional villages, and silent forests will flow endlessly on the tracks. There is no final destination, just a constant and regenerating flow to get lost in. Find your seat on the train and disconnect from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.poster.avif?t=1784666467\" width=1170 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.webm?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809260/extras/f510fbc588b7da7a53d5fd8f75638167.mp4?t=1784666467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A nostalgic window into Japanese slice-of-life, perfect for those who find peace in the quiet beauty of rural landscapes and the rhythmic flow of a journey. Just enjoy the view.", "supported_languages